/**
 * Pictogram credits and licences (Settings → About → Pictogram credits & licences).
 * Lists every library that really has pictograms in the app (the list is generated by
 * scripts/build-pictograms.ts, so adding a library updates this page by itself), with its author,
 * website, licence, copyright notice, attribution statement and whether drawings were modified.
 * Licences that must be reproduced in full (MIT, ISC, Apache, OFL, Unicode) can be opened here.
 */
